5. NO ENDORSEMENT, NO AFFILIATION, NO TRADEMARK GRANT
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The author and the project name "Assetto Server Panel" are NOT affiliated
with, endorsed by, certified by, sponsored by, partnered with, or in any
official relationship to any of the parties listed below (collectively,
the "Affiliated Brands"), nor to any of their subsidiaries, parents,
affiliates, successors, assigns, or rights holders. The list is limited
to entities that the Software actually interacts with, depends on, or
whose assets ship bundled with the Software; it is not a general
disclaimer against every possible third party.

(a) Game, runtime, and distribution platform:

  - Kunos Simulazioni S.r.l., developer of "Assetto Corsa" and of the
    Assetto Corsa Dedicated Server (also distributed as "acServer"),
    the official server binary with which the Software communicates.
    The Software is an administrative interface that talks to the
    Assetto Corsa Dedicated Server over its documented HTTP and UDP
    plugin interfaces; the Software is not made by, on behalf of, or
    in cooperation with Kunos Simulazioni, and is not part of the
    Assetto Corsa product.
  - 505 Games S.p.A., publisher of "Assetto Corsa".
  - Valve Corporation, operator of the Steam platform on which
    "Assetto Corsa" is distributed and through whose lobby system
    public servers operated by Users of the Software may be discovered
    by players.

(b) Community projects and tools the Software may interoperate with:

  - The community projects and websites commonly known as "Content
    Manager", "acstuff", and "acstuff.club", which are produced by
    third-party authors and operated independently from this project.
    The Software produces server-configuration files (server_cfg.ini,
    entry_list.ini) that Content Manager and the acstuff lobby read in
    their documented format; that interoperability does not constitute
    an affiliation.

(c) Notification and integration services the Software may call out to:

  - Discord Inc., whose webhook endpoints the Software may POST to
    when an operator configures a record-notification webhook.
  - Cloudflare, Inc., whose tunneling and reverse-proxy services the
    Software's documentation recommends as a way to expose the panel
    to the internet without opening firewall ports, and whose
    "CF-Connecting-IP" header the Software honours when an operator
    sets TRUST_PROXY=1 in the environment.

(d) Open-source runtimes and libraries the Software depends on:

  - The OpenJS Foundation (Node.js runtime).
  - Meta Platforms Inc., maintainers of React (loaded at runtime from
    the unpkg CDN with Subresource Integrity hashes pinned in
    index.html).
  - The maintainers of each Third-Party Component listed in Section 6.

(e) Manufacturers and rights holders whose imagery may appear in the
Software's bundled "Kunos catalogue" assets (src/assets/kunos):

  The Software ships a copy of the Kunos catalogue thumbnails and UI
  JSON metadata that correspond to vehicles included with the base
  Assetto Corsa game and its Kunos-produced DLC packs. Those assets
  retain their original copyrights and trademarks, which belong to the
  vehicle manufacturers and to Kunos Simulazioni. The Software's only
  role is to surface those thumbnails in the panel's UI as visual
  references for an operator configuring a session. No endorsement,
  partnership, or commercial relationship between the author and any
  of the following manufacturers is implied or exists:

    Abarth · Alfa Romeo · Audi · BMW · Chevrolet · Ferrari · Ford ·
    Glickenhaus · KTM · Lamborghini · Lotus · Maserati · Mazda ·
    McLaren · Mercedes-Benz · Nissan · Pagani · Pininfarina ·
    Porsche · Praga · RUF · Shelby · Tatuus · Toyota.

  This list reflects the manufacturers represented in the bundled
  Kunos catalogue as of the publication date of this License. The
  same disclaimer extends to any racetrack, sponsor, livery, badge,
  championship, or other branded element appearing alongside those
  vehicles in the bundled assets.

All trademarks, service marks, trade names, product names, logos, and
brand designs that appear in the Software or in its documentation are
the property of their respective owners. Nothing in this License grants
